gate: OPEN
v:4 c:$ m:navitrack-config role:dev x:rust
task: S17 T1 — macOS Tauri build scripts + BLE permissions
sprint: S17
requires: [RUST_DEV, MOBILE_TAURI, FRONTEND_DEV, BUN]
test_mandate: ../intel/TEST-COVERAGE-MANDATE.md
quality_mandate: ../intel/CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md

context: |
  Enable reliable macOS desktop target for navitrack-config-app (Tauri 2 + tauri-plugin-blec).
  Add package.json scripts (e.g. macos:dev / tauri dev documented), Info.plist / entitlements /
  Bluetooth usage strings as required by macOS + blec/btleplug.
  Document any Xcode/signing prerequisites in short notes under sprints/S17/ or NATIVE-BLE.md.
  Package manager: bun.

out:
  - package.json scripts
  - src-tauri/* macOS plist/entitlements/conf as needed
  - intel/NATIVE-BLE.md or sprints/S17/MACOS-BUILD.md notes
  - *.test.ts only if code paths change

cmd:
  - bun run test

done:
  - Documented one-command macOS dev/build path
  - BLE privacy / entitlements present for macOS
  - `bun run test` passes
